Based on Nature's Compass
-------------------------

NaturesLodestone is an unofficial adaptation of Nature's Compass by Chaosyr
(MattCzyr), https://github.com/MattCzyr/NaturesCompass, version 3.3.1.
Nature's Compass is licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/).

NaturesLodestone was developed with reference to the source code of Nature's
Compass, and its code and text are adaptations of that work. Changes made:

- Reimplemented for Minecraft Bedrock Edition as a LeviLamina native mod written
  in C++ (dedicated server and client builds), instead of a Java mod.
- Uses Bedrock data formats: behavior pack and resource pack JSON, .lang files,
  server forms and JSON UI, and Bedrock biome identifiers and tags.
- New textures: the item textures are original pixel art generated by
  tools/textures/*.ps1; no textures, models or sounds of Nature's Compass are
  included.
- Bedrock-specific behaviour, documented as deviations in docs/SPEC.md.

NaturesLodestone is not affiliated with or endorsed by Chaosyr (MattCzyr),
Mojang Studios or Microsoft.

